    "Id": "vehicledef_PELE_LASER",
    "Name": "Pele (Laser)",
    "Details": "Designed to fulfil a multitude of support roles for the Hell's Horses, the Pele is a 35 ton escort tank mounting a modular 'Omni Turret'. Powered by a 140 rated Fuel Cell, the Pele is protected by 7.5 tons of armour, with a pair of Light Machine Guns mounted on the front hull. The Laser configuration crams a pair of Large Chemical Lasers with 4 tons of ammo into the turret.\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Biome Restrictions: None.</color></b>\n\n<b><color=#ffcc00>Movement: 4/6 hexes / 120/180 meters.</color></b>\n\n<color=#ffcc00><b>Armor:</b> Armor (C)\n<b>Structure:</b> Structure\n<b>Values       A        S  </b>\n<b>Front</b>       150     20\n<b>Left</b>         125     20\n<b>Right</b>       125     20\n<b>Rear</b>        100     20\n<b>Turret</b>      150     20\n\n<b>Total</b>      650    100</color>\n\n<color=#ff0000>Quirk: Main Battle Tank</color>\n\n<color=#ffcc00> Omni Vehicle</color>",
    "Icon": "Pele"
  },
